  style: {
    stroke: "#0D47A1"
    stroke-width: 2
    stroke-dash: 4
  }
  tooltip: "ID: projector_writes_read_model\nRelationship: writes\nContract: lineage, stack, review, and freshness projections\nAuthentication: projection workload credential\nMode: sync\nTimeout: 10s\nRetries: one transaction retry\nIdempotency: projection_revision plus entity_id\nFallback: rebuild from last checkpoint\nFailure propagation: context and operator views are stale\nEvidence: intended/design_document: docs/agent-provenance-ledger-and-codex-feedback.md:1#Agent Provenance Ledger and Codex Feedback Plan @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca; intended/external_document: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/queries-with.html @ PostgreSQL 18 current documentation"
  link: "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/queries-with.html"
